  "description": {
   "en": "\"Wait, from now on, I will inflict divine punishment.\"\n\nMaria, who had lived her best as the empress of the empire, as the emperor's wife.\nHowever, all that returned to her was the cruel betrayal of her husband and friend, and in the end, she only watched the deaths of her beloved ones.\nMaria, who was so thoroughly used by others, eventually gains the title of deposed empress and is dragged to another country."
